Package: com.cysxl.betterccbrightness
Name: BetterCCBrightness
Version: 2.0.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 13.0)
Conflicts: com.level3tjg.betterccbrightness
Replaces: com.level3tjg.betterccbrightness
Provides: com.level3tjg.betterccbrightness
Description: A fork of level3tjg's BetterCCBrightness.
 Adds more controls to the expanded brightness module in Control Center.
 * toggle auto-lock & auto-brightness.
 * reduce white point with an intensity slider.
 * set Night Shift strength with a slider.
 * show each brightness slider's level as a percentage.
Author: level3tjg, CySxL
Maintainer: CySxL
Icon: https://cysxl.github.io/icons/com.cysxl.betterccbrightness.png
Section: Tweaks
